<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Clear</h1>
<p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>clear tell
</pre>
<p>Clears your tell history: the list of tells you have received, which 
the game keeps for you (see <a cmd='#'>Help Tell</a>). clear on its own does nothing; 
it doesn't clear the screen.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Tell</a>
</pre>




</div>